  {"say": "Three doors. Three taxes. Pick one.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "*3* doors. *3* taxes. Pick one."},
  {"say": "Door one: income tax. A slice of what you earn.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "Door 1: *income tax*"},
  {"say": "You pay for being successful.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "You pay for being *successful*"},
  {"say": "Plus: the rich pay more. Minus: forms. So many forms.", "gap": 0.25, "screen": "Rich pay more. But *forms.* So many *forms.*"},
  {"say": "Door two: VAT, value added tax.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "Door 2: *VAT,* value added tax"},
  {"say": "You pay eighteen percent on hummus.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "*18%* on your hummus"},
  {"say": "Plus: simple, hard to dodge. Minus: it hits the poor hardest.", "gap": 0.25, "screen": "Simple. But hits the *poor* hardest"},
  {"say": "Door three: the jizya, a tax of old empires.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "Door 3: the *jizya*"},
  {"say": "Bonus: no army service included.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "Bonus: *no army service*"},
  {"say": "Wait. No reserve duty? Where do I sign?", "gap": 0.15},
  {"say": "The catch? Only if you're the wrong religion.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "The catch: only for *non-Muslims*"},
  {"say": "Non-Muslim men paid it. Protected, but not equal.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "Dhimmi status: *protected,* not *equal*"},
  {"say": "Ah. Hard pass.", "gap": 0.25},
  {"say": "The Ottomans dropped it in eighteen fifty six.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "Ottomans: gone *1856.* Persia: *1882.*"},
  {"say": "Only armed groups revived it: the Pakistani Taliban, and ISIS, the Islamic State.", "gap": 0.25, "screen": "Revived only by *armed groups*"},
  {"say": "And in Israel? Jews, Muslims, Christians, Druze.", "gap": 0.15, "screen": "Israel: Jews, Muslims, Christians, Druze"},
  {"say": "Same income tax. Same VAT. Your faith doesn't change your bill.", "gap": 0.25, "screen": "Same tax. Same VAT. *Same bill.*"},
  {"say": "Taxes are never fun. Equal taxes are the fair kind.", "gap": 0.3},
  {"say": "So, would you rather pay?", "gap": 0.2}
 ],
